sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor A as Customer
  participant UI as «boundary»<br/>EnquiryDialog
  participant B as «boundary»<br/>SendEnquiryBoundary
  participant C as «control»<br/>SendEnquiryController
  participant InteriorDesignProject as «entity»<br/>InteriorDesignProject
  participant Enquiry as «entity»<br/>Enquiry
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  A->>UI: send an enquiry about an IDP
  UI->>B: POST /api/projects/{id}/enquiries (JWT)
  B->>C: send(Integer customerId, Integer projectId, EnquiryRequest request)
  alt IDP not visible or empty message
    C-->>B: ApiException
    B-->>UI: 404 / 400 error JSON
    UI-->>A: show error
  else valid
  C->>InteriorDesignProject: findVisibleById()
  InteriorDesignProject->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>InteriorDesignProject: rows
  InteriorDesignProject-->>C: result
  C->>Enquiry: save()
  Enquiry->>DB: SQL
  DB-->>Enquiry: rows
  Enquiry-->>C: result
  C-->>B: EnquiryCreated
  B-->>UI: 201 Created JSON
  UI-->>A: show result
  end